build.mjs generates dist/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt from the license files of every
third-party npm package actually included in the bundle. That file and esbuild's
dist/index.js.LEGAL.txt ship with the package. No runtime npm dependencies are
required on the target VPS.

